      "blocks": {
        "h1": { "type": "heading", "settings": { "heading": "<p>From the <em>oldest light on earth.</em></p>" } },
        "p1": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>Two hundred and fifty million years ago, before the Himalayas, a sea closed in what is now the northern edge of Pakistan. The water evaporated. The minerals it left behind compressed into salt — slowly, with iron giving the stone its colour, with eighty-four other trace minerals folded in invisibly. Today that deposit is called the Khewra mine, sitting in the Punjab Salt Range. It is the second-largest source of pink Himalayan salt in the world, and the oldest.</p>" } },
        "p2": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>HALORA begins there. Every gram of salt in every object we make is drawn from this stone. We do not import. We are sitting on the oldest light on earth — there is no need to bring any in.</p>" } },
        "h2": { "type": "heading", "settings": { "heading": "<p>The <em>four houses.</em></p>" } },
        "p3": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>We work in four directions, because salt does four things well — and we wanted to follow each one all the way down.</p><ul><li><strong>Wellness · Skincare</strong> — bars, scrubs, crystals, and one cool hand-carved tool. For the body, morning and night.</li><li><strong>Wellness · Therapy</strong> — weighted salt-filled cotton pillows and a soft healing light. For the slow ten minutes.</li><li><strong>Home · Light</strong> — hand-carved salt lamps. Soft amber-pink, steady through the night.</li><li><strong>Home · Kitchen</strong> — grinders, refills, and stone for the table. The daily plate and the slow Sunday lunch.</li></ul><p>Nineteen pieces in all. Every piece is hand-blended in our Lahore studio in small batches — typically a hundred units of a thing at a time.</p>" } },
        "h3": { "type": "heading", "settings": { "heading": "<p>What the brand <em>is built on.</em></p>" } },
        "s1": { "type": "subheading", "settings": { "text": "Single mineral, four houses" } },
        "p4": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>We use one ingredient as our spine. Everything else — the scent, the wood, the cotton, the carving — exists to let the salt do the work it is good at: cleansing, softening, holding warmth, lightly seasoning, glowing.</p>" } },
        "s2": { "type": "subheading", "settings": { "text": "Small-batch, in-house" } },
        "p5": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>No factory line. The bars are hand-cut. The scrubs are hand-whipped. The pillows are sewn in our studio. The lamps are hand-carved at the source. If something is delayed, it is because it has not yet been made.</p>" } },
        "s3": { "type": "subheading", "settings": { "text": "Pakistan-only at launch" } },
        "p6": { "type": "paragraph", "settings": { "text": "<p>We are starting where the salt is from. International shipping opens soon.</p>" } },
